    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dan Howard Auctioneers is delighted to present this three-bedroom bungalow set on c. 0.4 acres in the heart of Kilnagleary, Carrigaline. Built c.1950, this home offers a wonderful opportunity for those seeking a renovation or self-build project, with generous room proportions, a large mature site, and sheds to the rear — all within easy walking distance of Carrigaline's schools, sports clubs, and village amenities.\r\n\r\nLocation & Area Guide\r\n\r\nKilnagleary is one of Carrigaline's most established and convenient residential areas, just a short stroll from the town centre and yet with a lovely rural, mature feel.\r\n\r\nSchools: Families are extremely well served on the doorstep, with Carrigaline Educate Together National School located right in Kilnagleary itself. St. Mary's National School and Carrigaline Community School are close by in Waterpark, while Edmund Rice College is a short walk — giving a strong choice of primary and secondary options within minutes of the property.\r\n\r\nSport & Leisure: Carrigaline Tennis Club is based right on the Ferney Road in Kilnagleary, offering five floodlit courts and a clubhouse just around the corner. Carrigaline GAA, one of the oldest clubs in the county (founded 1884), fields both hurling and football teams at its grounds nearby, while Carrigaline United AFC (Ballea Park) caters for soccer. Between the three clubs, there's a strong community sporting scene on the doorstep for all ages.\r\n\r\nEmployment: Carrigaline's location makes it hugely popular with commuters working in Cork's pharma and biotech sector. Ringaskiddy — home to major employers including Pfizer, Johnson & Johnson (Janssen), and other multinational manufacturing operations — is only a short drive away, as is Cork City itself for those working further afield.\r\n\r\nAmenities: Carrigaline village itself offers a full range of everyday amenities — supermarkets, shops, restaurants, and services — all within easy reach on foot or by car."
      },
